{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2022-12-14 09:15:00', 'title': 'ILLUMINA RANKS AMONG TOP SCORES ON DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX AND CDP', 'text': 'AS OF DECEMBER 9, 2022 ILLUMINA AWARDED HIGHEST SCORE FROM S&P DOW JONES INDICES IN LIFE SCIENCES TOOLS & SERVICES SECTOR ILLUMINA RECEIVED LEADERSHIP SCORE WITH AN A- FROM CDP SAN DIEGO , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ: ILMN), A GLOBAL LEADER IN DNA SEQUENCING AND ARRAY-BASED TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS ACHIEVEMENT OF THE HIGHEST SCORE OUT OF 72 COMPANIES IN ITS INDUSTRY IN THE S&P GLOBAL CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY ASSESSMENT, ALSO KNOWN AS THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX (DJSI). THIS IS THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR THE COMPANY HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE PRESTIGIOUS LIST AND THE THIRD YEAR THAT IT HAS LED WITH THE HIGHEST SCORE IN THE\xa0LIFE SCIENCES TOOLS & SERVICES SECTOR\xa0INDUSTRY.'}